pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: pr-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 40, 420, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [left, middle]
      text: PRACTICE · 10 MIN
  - elementId: pr-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 68, 832, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 30
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.2
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "Your turn: convert a flow rate to minutes"
  - elementId: pr-task-panel
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 132, 520, 150]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: pr-task-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 146, 160, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$primary"
      letterSpacing: 1.6
      align: [left, middle]
      text: TASK
  - elementId: pr-task-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 172, 480, 96]
    content:
      fontSize: 19
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: A tank holds 1.5 m³. The pump moves 20 L/min. How many minutes until it is full, to the nearest minute?
  - elementId: pr-check-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [608, 132, 288, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$primary"
      letterSpacing: 1.6
      align: [left, middle]
      text: CHECK
  - elementId: pr-check-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [608, 160, 288, 120]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        • You converted m³ to litres first.
        • The answer carries the unit minutes.
        • Your value is within ±1 minute of 75.
  - elementId: pr-hint
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 300, 832, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: "Hint: 1 m³ = 1,000 L. Write the unit beside every number before you divide."
  - elementId: pr-answer-panel
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 360, 832, 72]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primarySoft"}
  - elementId: pr-answer-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 372, 120, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$primary"
      letterSpacing: 1.6
      align: [left, middle]
      text: ANSWER
  - elementId: pr-answer-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 396, 792, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "1.5 m³ = 1,500 L; 1,500 ÷ 20 = 75 minutes. The unit and the value both pass the check."
  - elementId: pr-source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 504, 760, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "Source: practice set B, item 4; answer key verified against the course solution sheet."
  - elementId: pr-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [900, 504, 28, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "06"
